     vviirrttiioo__ccoonnssoollee — VirtIO Console driver

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     To compile this driver into the kernel, place the following lines in your
     kernel configuration file:

           ddeevviiccee vviirrttiioo__ccoonnssoollee

     Alternatively, to load the driver as a module at boot time, place the
     following line in loader.conf(5):

           virtio_console_load="YES"

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The vviirrttiioo__ccoonnssoollee device driver provides support for VirtIO console de‐
     vices.

     The console device may have one or more ports.  Each port is similar to a
     simple serial interface, and each port is accessible through tty(4).

